	(text "33 castellated contacts to the core strip (switch-board contract, SWB-016); unused rows and the reserved lines\nstay unconnected. USB-C port B at the back-left corner (SWB-015): VBUS_B, D+/D- and CC straight to the core,\nESD arrays next to the receptacle; Rd and CC sensing are on the core."
